{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.32","index":32,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.32.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"wéi","traditional":"唯","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诚","pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"誠","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"fāng","traditional":"方","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"经","pinyin":"jīng","traditional":"經","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"纶","pinyin":"lún","traditional":"綸","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"经","pinyin":"jīng","traditional":"經","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"lì","traditional":"立","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xià","traditional":"下","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dà","traditional":"大","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"běn","traditional":"本","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"de","traditional":"地","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"huà","traditional":"化","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yù","traditional":"育","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"fū","traditional":"夫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"倚","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"？"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Hanya seorang yang telah mencapai Puncak Iman di dunia ini dapat membukukan dan menghimpun Kitab Besar Dunia, menegakkan Pokok Besar Dunia, mengetahui peleburan dan pemeliharaan diantara langit dan bumi. Maka adakah tempat lain yang lebih teguh sebagai tempat bersandar?"},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.32.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zhūn","traditional":"肫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhūn","traditional":"肫","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"！"},{"modern":"渊","pinyin":"yuān","traditional":"淵","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"渊","pinyin":"yuān","traditional":"淵","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"渊","pinyin":"yuān","traditional":"淵","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"！"},{"pinyin":"hào","traditional":"浩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hào","traditional":"浩","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"！"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Betapa tulus dan sungguh-sungguh Cinta Kasihnya; betapa dalam dan tenang, betapa luas dan besar memenuhi langit."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.32.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gǒu","traditional":"苟","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"固","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"聪","pinyin":"cōng","traditional":"聰","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"明","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"圣","pinyin":"shèng","traditional":"聖","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"达","pinyin":"dá","traditional":"達","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"tiān","traditional":"天","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shú","traditional":"孰","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"？"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Maka kalau bukan seorang yang benar jelas pendengaran, terang penglihatan, suci dan bijaksana sehingga dapat mencapai Kebajikan Tuhan; siapakah pula yang mengerti sebab- sebabnya sehingga dapat demikian? TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB XXXII (Maha Sempurna Tuhan)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/32 - Bab XXXI - Sandaran Yang Teguh.md","title":"Bab XXXI — Sandaran Yang Teguh"}
